     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10;mso-tab-count:1;">      </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">NE-0747-0001,   WA 6.2  -  D A C H A B D I C H T E R ,  S P E N G L E R</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">02.01 Allgemeines</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">02.02 Dachdeckungs- und Abdichtungsarbeiten</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">02.03 Spengler- bzw. Klempnerarbeiten</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">02.04 Au</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ß</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">enanlagen Dachfl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">chen</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;tab-stops:10.00mm 12.60mm 25.30mm 38.00mm 50.70mm 63.40mm 76.10mm 88.80mm 101.50mm 114.20mm 126.90mm 139.60mm 152.30mm 165.00mm;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">03</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10;mso-tab-count:1;">      </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">NE-0748-0001,   WA 1.2  -  D A C H A B D I C H T E R,  S P E N G L E R</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">03.01 Allgemeines</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">03.02 Dachdeckungs- und Abdichtungsarbeiten</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">03.03 Spengler- bzw. Klempnerarbeiten</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">03.04 Au</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ß</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">enanlagen Dachfl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">chen</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:justify;line-height:87pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
