     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hrend des Rohbaus </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">bernimmt der AN Baumeister die Schlie</span>
