     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hrend seiner Bauphase tr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">gt er die Verantwortung f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r den Bauzaun und den Verschluss der Baustelle. Sofern der AN einzelne Baufelder zu Transportzwecken </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ffnet, tr</span>
