     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">rdliche Genehmigungen, Beschilderungen, Stra</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ß</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">enverkehr</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Die Einholung aller zus</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tzlichen und erforderlichen beh</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">rdlichen Genehmigungen, und Erf</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">llung beh</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">rdlicher Auflagen ist einzukalkulieren. Alle erforderlichen Beschilderungen sind einzukalkulieren.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Der Stra</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ß</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">enverkehr darf in keiner Weise behindert werden. Die notwendigen Vorsorgema</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ß</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">nahmen sind einzukalkulieren, die Vorhaltung wird erst nach Beendigung der Bauhauptarbeiten verg</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tet, sofern hier gesonderte Pos. vorgesehen sind.</span>
     <br/>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.2.27  Bauablaufplanung</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Der AN hat den Terminplan seines Gewerkes zu pr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">fen und Bedenken schriftlich im Zuge des Angebotes anzumelden. Er hat einen auf sein Gewerk bezogenen Detailterminplan zu erstellen.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Innerhalb von 14 Tagen nach Auftragserteilung ist zusammen mit der jeweiligen Objekt</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">berwachung ein detaillierter Termin- und Arbeitsablaufplan </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ber die zu erbringenden Leistungen zu erstellen, anhand dessen die Einhaltung der Vertragsfristen nachgewiesen und </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">berwacht werden kann. Die Festlegungen des AG, z.B. zur baufachlichen oder terminlichen Koordinierung mit den </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">brigen Leistungsbereichen, sind zu ber</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">cksichtigen. Zudem ist die geplante Baustellenbesetzung zu benennen.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Bei </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">nderungen der Vertragsfristen oder bei erheblichen Abweichungen von sonstigen Festlegungen ist der Termin- und Arbeitsablaufplan unverz</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">glich zu </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">berarbeiten.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Die Ablaufgeschwindigkeiten und Reihenfolgen m</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ssen mit der zust</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ndigen O</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);"> abgestimmt werden und deren Zustimmung erhalten. </span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Die Arbeiten k</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">nnen ggf. nur abschnittsweise ausgef</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hrt und fertig gestellt werden. Montagen sind ggf. zeitlich versetzt auszuf</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hren.</span>
