     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hrungsunterlagen vom AG f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r den AN</span>
