     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.2.30  Nachweise</span>
     <br/>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Soweit mit den Nachweisen zum Angebot nicht bereits gefordert, kann der Auftraggeber den Nachweis verlangen, dass die f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r den Einbau vorgesehenen Baustoffe, Konstruktionen und die angewandten Verfahren den Normen und der geforderten Qualit</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ten entsprechen. </span>
     <br/>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Nachweise sind zu erbringen durch: </span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;tab-stops:20.10mm 25.30mm 38.00mm 50.70mm 63.40mm 76.10mm 88.80mm 101.50mm 114.20mm 126.90mm 139.60mm 152.30mm 165.00mm 177.70mm;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10;mso-tab-count:1;">                   </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- Pr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">fzeugnisse amtlich anerkannter Pr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">finstitute</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;tab-stops:20.10mm 25.30mm 38.00mm 50.70mm 63.40mm 76.10mm 88.80mm 101.50mm 114.20mm 126.90mm 139.60mm 152.30mm 165.00mm 177.70mm;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10;mso-tab-count:1;">                   </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- Bauaufsichtliche Zulassungen</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;tab-stops:20.10mm 25.30mm 38.00mm 50.70mm 63.40mm 76.10mm 88.80mm 101.50mm 114.20mm 126.90mm 139.60mm 152.30mm 165.00mm 177.70mm;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10;mso-tab-count:1;">                   </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- Abgabe Fachunternehmer-Erkl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">rungen</span>
