    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.5.4  Bedienungsanweisungen</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Der AN hat dem AG rechtzeitig, jedoch mindestens 4 Wochen vor dem Einweisungstermin von Anlagen etc. die f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r den Betreiber notwendigen Dokumente wie Bedienungsanleitungen, Inspektionspl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ne, Wartungshandb</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">cher etc. zu </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">bergeben. Anzustreben ist eine </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">bergabe der Unterlagen bereits bei der Einreichung der jeweiligen Werk- und Montageplanung.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.5.5  Kalkulationshinweise</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Alle f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r die Herstellung der Konstruktionen des AN notwendigen Ausschnitte, Schr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">gschnitte, Ausklinkungen, Rundloch- und Langlochbohrungen, etc. in den Bauteilen des AN sind in die Einheitspreise einzurechnen, auch wenn dies in einzelnen Positionen nicht gesondert erw</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hnt wird. Gleiches gilt auch f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r Anarbeiten von Bauteilen des AN an andere, angrenzende Bauteile des AN. Jedoch kann aus einer Erw</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hnung in einzelnen Positionen (Kalkulationshilfe) kein R</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ckschluss gezogen werden, dass diese Leistungen in anderen Positionen ohne diese besonderen Erw</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hnung nicht in die Einheitspreise einzukalkulieren sind.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.5.6  Widerspruch Langtext zu Kurztext</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Bei eventuell fehlender </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">bereinstimmung (Widerspruch) zwischen Langtext und Kurztext gilt in jedem Fall nur der Langtext der Leistungsbeschreibung.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.5.7  Bestandsdokumentation</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Alle vom Auftragnehmer anzufertigenden Ausf</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hrungsunterlagen sind auf den Stand des ausgef</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hrten Zustandes zu bringen und zusammen mit Pr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">fzeugnissen, Zulassungen, Wartungsanweisungen, </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">bersicht von eingebauten Materialien und Einbauteilen etc., in beschrifteten Ordnern, mit Inhaltsverzeichnissen und Trennbl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ttern, vom Auftragnehmer zusammenzustellen.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Der Aufwand wird gesondert verg</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tet.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Eventuelle </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">nderungen von Materialien sind dem AG unmittelbar darauf schriftlich mitzuteilen. Die Ausf</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hrung der </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">nderungen darf jedoch nur nach schriftlicher Zustimmung des AG erfolgen. Die Unterlagen sind dann entsprechend auszutauschen.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Der AG beh</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">lt sich vor, nicht entsprechende Baustoffe zur</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ckzuweisen bzw. im Falle von Zweifeln an deren G</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">te entsprechende G</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tenachweise durch eine amtlich anerkannte Pr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">fstelle oder einer vom AG anerkannten Pr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">fstelle zu verlangen.</span>
    </p>
