     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">rungen</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Die Bestandsdokumentation muss 2 Wochen vor der Abnahme zur Pr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">fung vorliegen. Das Personal des AG ist in eventuell erforderliche Betriebsanleitungen etc. einzuweisen.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.5.8  Detail- und Montagepl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ne</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Erforderliche Detail- und Errichtungspl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ne zur Herstellung der Leistungen dieses Leistungsverzeichnisses werden nicht gesondert verg</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tet.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.5.9  Ger</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ste</span>
     <br/>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.5.9.1 Arbeits- und Sicherheitsger</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ste</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">S</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">mtliche Arbeits-, Sicherheits- und Schutzger</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ste mit einer Arbeitsh</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">he bis 3,5m </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ber Standh</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">he (DIN EN 12810-1 + DIN 18451) sind f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r die Dauer der vollst</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ndigen eigenen Leistungserbringung eigenverantwortlich zu stellen, vorzuhalten und zu entfernen. Ger</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ste werden nicht gesondert verg</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tet.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.5.9.2 Fassadenger</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ste</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Ein Fassadenger</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">st wird bauseits durch das Gewerk AN Baumeister zur Verf</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">gung gestellt. Inklusive Koordination mit dem Gewerk AN Baumeister. Das Fassadenger</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">st bleibt bis Fertigstellung der Arbeiten auf den D</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">chern stehen.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.5.10 Materialien und Verarbeitungsvorschrift</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">F</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r die Werkstoffe d</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">rfen nur Markenerzeugnisse verwendet werden, die einer laufenden G</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tekontrolle durch Materialpr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">fanstalten unterliegen und bauaufsichtlich zugelassen sind. Die Verarbeitungsvorschriften der Materialhersteller der jeweiligen Erzeugnisse sind unbedingt einzuhalten. Es sind grunds</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tzlich nur die zu den angebotenen Erzeugnissen geh</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">renden Systemkomponenten zu verwenden.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Grunds</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tzlich sind die Material</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">kologischen Vorgaben der LHM </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ber die Verwendung von Stoffen unbedingt einzuhalten. Des Weiteren ist die Nachhaltigkeitsleitlinie EOM zu beachten und anzuwenden.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">F</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r die einzelnen Materialien und Bauteile mit besonderen Anforderungen sind Nachweise, Zulassungen oder Pr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">fbescheide vorzulegen; dies betrifft z. B. die Abdichtungskleber, Fliesen, Verfugungsm</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">rtel, Profile, das dauerelastische Verfugungsmaterial etc..</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Die in den Leistungsbeschreibungen aufgef</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hrten Baustoffe sind vom AN hinsichtlich der geforderten G</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">te und Qualit</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">t auf ihre Richtigkeit und Eignung im Objekt zu </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">berpr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">fen.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Auf Verlangen des AG ist vom AN der Nachweis vorzulegen, dass die Baustoffe den gestellten Anforderungen entsprechen.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.5.11 Schnittstelle:</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Es ist eine Koordination mit den am Bau beteiligten Auftragnehmern notwendig, die laut Terminplanung gleichzeitig T</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tigkeiten/Arbeiten in Zusammenhang mit dem eigenen Auftrag/Gewerk aus</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ben.</span>
     <br/>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Betoneinlegearbeiten:</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Die Koordination und der rechtzeitige Abruf der Leistung (Mindestvorlaufzeit 3 Werktage) mit den betroffenen Firmen liegt beim AN.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Es ist eine Koordination mit dem AN Baumeister notwendig.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Der AN Baumeister errichtet den Rohbau und das WDVS und das Ger</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">st.</span>
     <br/>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Es ist eine Koordination mit dem AN Fensterbau notwendig.</span>
     <br/>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Es ist eine Koordination mit dem AN ELT, AN HKLS zu erfolgen.</span>
     <br/>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Die Einlegearbeiten f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r den Bereich ELT und  HKLS werden dem Grunde nach bauseits geleistet. Motor, Taster, Kabelpeitschen, Erdung und Blitzschutz falls erforderlich, etc. werden bauseits geleistet. </span>
     <br/>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Eine weitere Koordination hat mit dem AN Landschaftsbau zu erfolgen.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Auf den Dachfl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">chen ist die Schnittstelle die OK Dachabdichtung </span>
     <br/>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Im Rahmen der w</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">chentlich stattfindenden Jour-fixe hat eine Koordination mit allen anderen am Bau beteiligten Gewerken zu erfolgen.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.5.12 Entsorgung, Abwasser und Abfallbeseitigung</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Gem</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">äß</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);"> VOB/C hat der Auftragnehmer s</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">mtliche von seinen Arbeiten herr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hrende Verunreinigungen, Abf</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">lle, Bauschutt udgl. zu beseitigen. Diese sind arbeitst</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">glich auf eigene Kosten aus dem Geb</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ude und von der Baustelle abzutransportieren und zu entsorgen. Die Aufstellfl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">chen von eventuellen Containern der Auftragnehmer sind mit der Objekt</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">berwachung abzustimmen. Die Lagerung hat getrennt gem</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">äß</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);"> 4 Abs. 2 der Gewerbe- und Baustellenabfallentsorgungssatzung zu erfolgen.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Kommt der Auftragnehmer dieser Regelung trotz einmaliger Aufforderung nicht nach, wird die Beseitigung der Verunreinigung durch die Objekt</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">berwachung auf Kosten des Auftragnehmers veranlasst.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Die gesamte Baustelle wird nach Erfordernis jeweils am vorletzten Arbeitstag (Donnerstag) einer Arbeitswoche gereinigt. Hierf</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r stellen die Auftragnehmer kostenlos eine entsprechende Anzahl von Arbeitskr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ften einschlie</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ß</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">lich Arbeitsmittel zur Verf</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">gung, soweit ihre Arbeiten zur Verschmutzung der Baustellen beigetragen haben. </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ber den Einsatz dieser Arbeitskr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">fte entscheidet die Objekt</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">berwachung in Abstimmung mit den Fachbauleitern. Kommt ein Auftragnehmer, trotz erfolgter Abstimmung dieser Obliegenheit nicht nach, wird auf seine Kosten eine Ersatzarbeitskraft beigestellt.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Hinweis: Die Reinigung des </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ffentlichen Stra</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ß</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">enraumes, der von Fahrzeugen des AN verschmutzt wird ist verpflichtend und wird nicht gesondert verg</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tet.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.5.13  Verunreinigte Materialien</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Die Zwischenlagerung zur Beurteilung von verunreinigtem Materialien vor Ort ist so zu gestalten, dass keine Schadstoffverfrachtung durch Staubverwehungen oder Niederschlagswasser zu bef</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">rchten ist.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Die Fl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">chen sind in Abstimmung mit der O</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);"> festzulegen.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Die Entsorgung und das Recycling von Abf</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">llen und der evtl. kontaminierten Materialien sind entsprechend den Vorgaben der Leistungsteile Erdarbeiten und Entsorgung Erdaushub zu handhaben und dort abzurechnen.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.5.14  Erschwernisse</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Die Arbeiten des AN erfolgen unter den Erschwernissen:</span>
    </p>
    <ul style="text-indent:17pt;margin-left:18pt;font-family:Symbol;font-size:10pt;">
     <li>
      <span style="font-family:Arial;">Die Arbeiten werden in einem bewohntem Gebiet durchgef</span>
      <span style="font-family:Arial;">ü</span>
      <span style="font-family:Arial;">hrt.</span>
     </li>
     <li>
      <span style="font-family:Arial;">Erschwernisse infolge H</span>
      <span style="font-family:Arial;">ö</span>
      <span style="font-family:Arial;">he sind zu beachten.</span>
     </li>
     <li>
      <span style="font-family:Arial;">Abstimmung mit AN Baumeister und AN Fensterbau und Installateur muss rechtzeitig erfolgen.</span>
     </li>
     <li>
      <span style="font-family:Arial;">Erschwernisse infolge von Balkonen und Vord</span>
      <span style="font-family:Arial;">ä</span>
      <span style="font-family:Arial;">chern.</span>
     </li>
     <li>
      <span style="font-family:Arial;">Die Baustelle gliedert sich in die Abschnitte WA1.1, WA1.2 und WA6.2. Die Gliederung gilt sowohl r</span>
      <span style="font-family:Arial;">ä</span>
      <span style="font-family:Arial;">umlich als auch abrechnungstechnisch. Als Konsequenz m</span>
      <span style="font-family:Arial;">ü</span>
      <span style="font-family:Arial;">ssen Rechnungen getrennt nach den Baufeldern WA1.1, WA1.2 und WA6.2 erstellt werden.</span>
     </li>
     <li>
      <span style="font-family:Arial;">Koordination mit s</span>
      <span style="font-family:Arial;">ä</span>
      <span style="font-family:Arial;">mtlichen Projektbeteiligten und Nachbargewerken.</span>
     </li>
    </ul>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.5.15 Naturma</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ß</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">e</span>
     <br/>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Jeder AN hat rechtzeitig vor seiner Arbeitsausf</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hrung die erforderlichen Unterlagen anzufordern, Naturma</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ß</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">e zu nehmen und die </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">bereinstimmung mit den Pl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">nen zu pr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">fen. Abweichungen von Plan- und Naturma</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ß</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">en sind dem AG oder dessen Beauftragten rechtzeitig vor Inangriffnahme der Arbeiten schriftlich bekannt zu geben. Unterl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">sst der AN diese </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">berpr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">fungen, so sind daraus entstehende Mehrkosten, die zur Behebung allf</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">lliger Differenzen auflaufen, vom AN ohne Anspruch auf R</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ckersatz zu bezahlen.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.5.17  Statik</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Der AN hat alle von Ihm angebotenen Konstruktionen (Einbauteile, Unterkonstruktionen, Aufh</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ngungen etc.) statisch zu </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">berpr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">fen und auf Anforderung des AG einen statischen Nachweis vorzulegen.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Der AN hat die statischen Berechnungen/Vordimensionierung der zum Einbau kommenden Teile wie z.B. die Konstruktion des Absturzgel</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">nders, allein verantwortlich durchzuf</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hren. Der AN best</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tigt mit der Abgabe seines Angebots, dass er bei der Bemessung der Kalkulation der ausgeschriebenen Leistung/Konstruktion alle wirkenden Belastungen in seinen Berechnungen ber</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">cksichtigt hat. Statische Bedenken gegen die geplante Ausf</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hrung der ausgeschriebenen Leistungen sind sp</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">testens mit Beginn der Montage-/Werkplanung schriftlich durch den Bieter dem AG mitzuteilen.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.5.18  Regieleistungen</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Grundbeschrieb Stundenlohnarbeiten Verrechnungss</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tze f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r L</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hne</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">in die Stundenlohnverrechnungss</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tze sind alle lohngebundenen Unkosten, Zuschl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ge, Ausl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">sen, Fahrgelder sowie die Beaufsichtigung und die Kosten f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r das gewerks</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">bliche Grundwerkzeug einzurechnen. </span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Die angefallenen Regiestunden, die nur auf Anordnung der </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">rtlichen Bauleitung bzw. AG durchgef</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hrt werden d</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">rfen, m</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ssen t</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">glich auf gesonderten Regieberichten zur Gegenzeichnung vorgelegt werden. </span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Nicht unterzeichnete und nachgeschobene Regiestunden und Materialien werden nicht verg</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tet. Regierechnungen sind auf Verlangen monatlich gesondert zu stellen und Kopien der von der Bauleitung unterzeichneten Rapportzetteln sind beizuf</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">gen.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Stundenlohnarbeiten d</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">rfen nur auf Anordnung durch den Auftraggeber ausgef</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hrt werden und sind t</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">glich von der O</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);"> best</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tigen zu lassen. Auf den Stundenlohnzetteln ist einzutragen:</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- Name, Vorname</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- Berufsgruppe</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- Datum</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- Uhrzeit Montagebeginn und -ende</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- Kurze Beschreibung der Arbeit - Materialverbrauch</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Die Verrechnungss</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tze f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r die nachstehenden Lohn- und Berufsgruppen sind unaufgegliedert anzubieten.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Anzubieten ist f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r die jeweilige Arbeitskraft (Lohn-und Berufsgruppe) ein Verrechnungssatz, der s</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">mtliche Aufwendungen enth</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">lt.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">In ihnen sind enthalten:</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- Lohn- und Gehaltskosten z.B. Tarifl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hne einschl. etwaiger Lohnzulagen, Lohnzuschl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ge und verm</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">genswirksamer Leistungen,</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- Lohn- und Gehaltsnebenkosten, z.B. Ausl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">sungen, Wegegelder, Wegzeitenentsch</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">digung, Fahrtkostenerstattung etc.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- Sozialkosten einschlie</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ß</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">lich Sozialkassenbeitr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ge</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- Zuschl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ge</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- Lohngebundene und lohnabh</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ngige Kosten</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- sonstige Sozialkosten</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- Nebenkosten f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r nicht gewerbliches Baustellenpersonal.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- Winterbauumlage, </span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- Gemeinkostenanteil jedoch ohne Umsatzsteuer,</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- Wagnis und Gewinn, jedoch ohne Umsatzsteuer,</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- An- und Abfahrt zu und von der Baustelle</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- Kosten f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r benutzte Kleinger</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">te bis zu einem Neuwert von EUR 2.500,-</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Die Verg</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tung f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r nicht angebotene Lohngruppen wird auf der Grundlage des Tariflohnes zzgl. Gesamtunternehmerzuschlag ermittelt. (Der Gesamtunternehmerzuschlag wird ermittelt als Mittelwert der angebotenen Lohngruppen ). </span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Zuschl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ge zu den Verrechnungss</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tzen f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r vom Auftraggeber angeordnete oder zu vertretende Nacht-, Sonntags-, Feiertags- und Mehrarbeit (</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">berstunden) sind gesondert nachzuweisen; sie werden in H</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">he der tariflichen Vereinbarung verg</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tet.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">F</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r Nacht-, Sonntags- und Feiertagsarbeit wird als Zuschlag nur der Beitrag zur gesetzlichen Unfallversicherung verg</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tet. F</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r Mehrarbeit werden zus</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tzlich die Sozialkosten verg</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tet.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">F</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r die Verg</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tung von Zeit- und Erschwerniszuschl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ge sind die tariflichen Rahmenbestimmungen f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r den jeweiligen Leistungsbereich anzuwenden. Die Zeitzuschl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ge (Mehr-,Sp</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">t-,Nacht-,Sonntags-und Feiertagsarbeit) werden nur verg</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tet, wenn diese vom Auftraggeber ausdr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">cklich gefordert wurden.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Sie werden auf der Basis des tats</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">chlich ausbezahlten und nachgewiesenen Lohnes (ohne Lohnnebenkosten) berechnet. Hierzu sind vom AN auf Verlangen des AG Gehaltsnachweise der Arbeiter vorzulegen, f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r die Zeit-und Erschwerniszuschl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ge geltend gemacht werden.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Verg</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tet wird nur der tats</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">chlich am Ausf</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hrungsort geleistete Zeitaufwand, d.h. An- und Abfahrtszeiten sowie Fahrtkosten werden nicht ber</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">cksichtigt.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Besch</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ftigt der Bieter bei einer der nachstehenden Lohn-/Berufsgruppen keine Arbeitskr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">fte, hat er dies anzugeben und statt dessen den Einsatz m</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">glichst gleichwertiger Arbeitskr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">fte anzubieten.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Sonstiges</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">F</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r die Ausf</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hrung von untergeordneten Leistungen, wie z.B. Stemm-, Reinigungsarbeiten etc., wird nur der Lohn eines Bauwerkers /Helfer verg</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tet, auch wenn vom Auftragnehmer h</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">her qualifiziertes Personal eingesetzt wird.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Stunden von aufsichtsf</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hrendem Personal</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">(Bauleiter, Montageinspektoren etc.) f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r Besprechungen, Koordination, Abstimmung,  Aufma</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ß</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);"> und Abrechnung, usw. werden nicht gesondert verg</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tet. Diese Kosten sind mit den angebotenen Stundenlohns</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tzen abgegolten.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
   </DetailAddText>
  </AddText>
  <AddText>
   <OutlineAddText>
    <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span>ZTV - Abdichtungsarbeiten</span>
     <br/>
    </p>
   </OutlineAddText>
   <DetailAddText>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.6  Zus</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tzliche technische Vertragsbedingungen (ZTV) - Abdichtungsarbeiten</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.6.1  Allgemeines</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Auch wenn in Positionen im Besonderen auf einzelne Punkte der ZTV hingewiesen wird, so behalten auch nicht erw</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hnte relevante Punkte deren G</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ltigkeit. Ebenso kann aus einer besonderen Erw</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hnung in einzelnen Punkten der ZTV wie &#x22;ist in den EP einzurechnen&#x22; kein R</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ckschluss gezogen werden, dass andere Punkte der ZTV ohne diese besondere Erw</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hnung nicht in die EP einzukalkulieren sind.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">S</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">mtliche angegebenen Ma</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ß</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">e sind Zirka-Ma</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ß</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">e und vor Ausf</span>
