     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">- Inklusive Koordinationsgespr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">che mit den Gewerken Baumeister/Rohbau, ELT, HKLS, Fassade, Fenster, T</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">rbau, etc... ohne gesonderte Verg</span>
