     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hrung</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;text-decoration:underline;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.6.4.1  Schnittstelle AN Rohbau, AN Fenster, AN Landschaftsbauer, AN Dachabdichter</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Dachfl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">chen:</span>
     <br/>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Es ist im Rahmen der Koordinationspflicht mit den Folgegewerken abzustimmen, dass die Materialvertr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">glichkeiten mit seitens der Folgegewerke verwendeten Produkte vorliegen.</span>
    </p>
