    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;text-decoration:underline;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.6.4.2 Verwendung von Aluminium</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Aluminium-Verbot bei der Landeshauptstadt M</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">nchen; Ausnahme: Der Anteil von &#x22;Sekund</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r-Aluminium&#x22; (Recycling-Anteil) betr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">gt nachweislich mind. 50%. Eine diesbez</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">gliche Best</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tigung ist vorzulegen.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <br/>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;text-decoration:underline;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.6.4.3  Versinterungsgefahr</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Aufgrund der Gefahr von Versinterungen der Drainschichten und Abl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ufe ist nach M</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">glichkeit auf die Verwendung von Frischbeton und M</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">rtel (z.B. f</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">r Betonkeile bei Plattenbel</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">gen) bei Dachbegr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">nungen grunds</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tzlich zu verzichten.</span>
     <br/>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Betonfundamente sind als Fertigteile oder als Ortbeton zul</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ssig. Sind Betonierarbeiten zwingend erforderlich sind diese in Abstimmung mit der O</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);"> und mit speziellen Vorkehrungen auszuf</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hren. (Schutzfolien, getrennte Betonierbereiche, Mischvorgang nicht in Bereichen der Dachfl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">chen, etc.; Arbeitsbereiche und Zug</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">nge bei Arbeiten auf der Dachfl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">che sind entsprechend zu sch</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tzen.) Dies wird nicht gesondert verg</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tet.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;text-decoration:underline;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.6.4.4  Sturmsichere Befestigung</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">S</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">mtliche verbaute Bauteile m</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ssen, wenn auch in der Position nicht ausdr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">cklich erw</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">hnt, den </span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ö</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">rtlichen Gegebenheiten entsprechend sturmsicher montiert und befestigt werden.</span>
