    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;text-decoration:underline;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.6.4.7 Gef</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;text-decoration:underline;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;text-decoration:underline;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">lleausbildung</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Die Gef</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">lleausbildung der Dachfl</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">chen erfolgt durch die Gef</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">lled</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">mmung. S</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">mtliche Gef</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">lleformen sind in den jeweiligen Dachdraufsichten ersichtlich und mit der Gef</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">lled</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">mmposition abzugelten. Gegengef</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ä</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">llekeile, Schweinsr</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">cken, etc. werden nicht gesondert verg</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">ü</span>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">tet.</span>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
    <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
     <span style="font-family:Arial;text-decoration:underline;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">0.6.4.8  Spenglerarbeiten bzw. Klempnerarbeiten</span>
     <br/>
     <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Background:rgb(255,255,255);">Bei Spenglerarbeiten (Klempnerarbeiten) gelten f</span>
